Day_01_town_center
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/town_center_placeholder.jpg" fade="1.0"]
Narrator: Catherine reaches the town center with magnificent buildings and a big fountain.
Narrator: As she walks by, she notices an old woman giving breadcrumbs to pigeons.
Narrator: Thinking to herself that the woman might know a lot about the story of this town, she decides to walk up and talk to her.
join Old_woman center [animation="Fade In Up" length="1.0" wait="true"]
catherine: Hello, My name is Catherine and I am a newcomer to this town. Do you happen to have a minute ? I’ve got some questions to ask.
Old_woman: Morning !
Old_woman: A new face coming to town, that’s quite peculiar. What can I do for you dear ?
- Directly ask about the monsters and the tales Catherine’s mother told
	catherine: I know it may come off as weird but I’ve heard a lot of tales surrounding this town, something about magic and monsters.
	catherine: And how to say .. it.
	Old_woman: You wanna ask if they are real, that’s it, right ?
	catherine: yes, yes.. how do you know ?
	Old_woman: Well, you know. I've lived long enough. I’ve seen and heard a lot of things during my life. And I am quite old.
	catherine: So they are real, right
	Old_woman: I don’t think it’s useful to hide something for you because you’re gonna meet them soon enough if you stay in this town. But you seem quite excited. Why so ?
	catherine: Oh you know, I’ve got something to ask, or a … wish.
	Old_woman: A wish ? I don’t know what stories you heard about this town. But if you think about wishes or your own person, better stay clear of the creatures.
	catherine:  I don’t really understand
	Old_woman: Just stay clear of them. It’s getting late. Also, walls here have eyes and ears. I think I am going to go home.
	Old_woman: Looking forward to seeing you around. Please stay safe as clear of anything supernatural.
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
- Ask about why there are not many newcomers
	catherine: Quite peculiar you say ? What do you mean ? This town looks beautiful and agreeable to live in.
	Old_woman:  Let’s say there are things that happen in this town that are out of the ordinary.
	catherine: I've heard this town has some unusual creatures living nearby. Are those even real and  what are they like?
	Old_woman:  You just came to Shateroo, right ?
	catherine: yes, that's right.
	Old_woman: I am sure you will encounter them sooner or later. Just make sure to be understanding. After all, all creatures have emotions and feelings.
	catherine: I can’t quite follow you
	Old_woman: I am sure you’ll understand soon enough. You should leave now. It’s getting late. Better leave now and find a place to stay. There is an inn on the main road of the town.
	Old_woman: They will likely have a room for you for an affordable place.
	Old_woman: Better move. You don’t wanna stay late outside in this town.
	Old_woman: Okay, see you around town. I’ll get moving.
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
leave Old_woman [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
jump day_01_monster/